---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Card Night Privacy Policy" description="How the Card Night app handles your data.">
  <article class="wrapper">
    <h1>Card Night Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Effective September 29, 2026</em></p>

    <p>Card Night is a card games app for iPhone and iPad made by Wes Rogers. This policy explains
    what data the app uses and why.</p>

    <h2>Data kept on your device</h2>
    <p>Your settings, statistics and games in progress are stored only on your device. They are not
    sent to us, and we don't run any servers or accounts for the app.</p>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>Card Night shows ads through Google AdMob. To serve and measure ads, Google may collect your
    device's advertising identifier (only if you allow tracking), IP address, general location
    derived from it, ad interactions, and crash and performance data. When the app first launches,
    iOS asks whether you allow tracking. If you decline, you still see ads, but they are not
    personalized. You can change this any time in Settings › Privacy &amp; Security › Tracking.
    Google's use of this data is described in
    <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">How Google uses information from sites or apps that use its services</a>
    and the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>Online play</h2>
    <p>Online games use Apple's Game Center. Your Game Center name is shown to the other players in a
    match, and game moves are sent between players' devices through Apple. Apple's handling of
    Game Center data is covered by the <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apple Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>Card Night is not directed at children under 13, and we don't knowingly collect personal
    information from them.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>If this policy changes, the new version will be posted on this page with a new effective date.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:wesrog@gmail.com?subject=Card%20Night%20privacy">wesrog@gmail.com</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
